; Seven TextEdit and CodeEdit boxes of 240x84. The one variable of each: TextEdit has six lines (vertical bar);
; Wide has a 52 character line, wrap off (horizontal bar); Wrap has a 62 character line with wrap_mode = 1 (bar,
; and the wrap width takes the bar's 8 px); Fits has two lines (no bar); Code is a CodeEdit with six lines and
; line numbers; PastEnd sets scroll_past_end_of_file (a shorter grabber); FitHeight sets scroll_fit_content_height
; (no bar). TextEdit::_update_scrollbars (text_edit.cpp:8587-8656) decides each. No other fixture overflows a box.

